A NOTE ON CHILD SAFETY

This Software implements protections for minors: verifiable parental consent,
age gates that no subscription can purchase past, on-device-only rendering for
under-13 accounts, exclusion of minors from recordings, and an unconditional
panic exit.

These are not optional features. Anyone deploying this Software or a
derivative to real families is responsible for their own compliance with
COPPA, GDPR/GDPR-K, the UK Age Appropriate Design Code, and any other law
applicable in their jurisdiction. Removing or weakening these protections
while retaining the attribution above misrepresents the original work.
